      "section_heading_before": "",
      "question_markdown": "15. （本小题满分13分）已知集合 $A=\\left\\{x\\mid\\frac{2-x}{x+2}>0\\right\\}$，$B=\\{x\\mid|x-1|>2\\}$，$C=\\{x\\mid m-1<x<2m+1\\}$。\n(1) 求 $A\\cap B$，$(\\complement_R B)\\cup A$；\n(2) 若 $A\\cap C=C$，求实数 $m$ 的取值范围。",
      "question_review": {
        "status": "reviewed_via_api2_atomic_patch",
        "source_context_ids": [
          "C001"
        ],
        "recognition_profile_version": "symbol_profile_v3",
        "symbol_audit_target_count": 0,
        "symbol_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_version": "figure_audit_v1",
        "figure_audit_target_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_observations": [],
        "lint_actions": [
          "kept_first_pass_answer_byte_exact"
        ],
        "context_manifest": "/home/puppeteer/MathOCRClaw/benchmark/test_runs/04-api2-triple-average/qwen3.8-max/workflow/page25/code_outputs/match/question_contexts.json"
      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "解：$\\because A=\\left\\{x\\mid\\frac{2-x}{x+2}>0\\right\\}$\n$\\therefore A=\\{x\\mid-2<x<2\\}$\n$B=\\{x\\mid|x-1|>2\\}$\n$\\therefore B=\\{x\\mid x<-1\\text{ 或 }x>3\\}$\n$\\therefore A\\cap B=\\{x\\mid-2<x<-1\\}$\n$\\therefore \\complement_R B=\\{x\\mid-1\\leq x\\leq 3\\}$\n$(\\complement_R B)\\cup A=\\{x\\mid-2<x\\leq 3\\}$\n(2) $\\because A\\cap C=C$\n$\\therefore C\\subseteq A$\n当 $C$ 为空集时\n$m-1\\geq 2m+1$\n$-2\\geq m$\n若 $C$ 不为空时\n$\\begin{cases} m-1\\geq-2 \\\\ 2m+1\\leq 2 \\end{cases}\\Rightarrow\\begin{cases} m\\geq-1 \\\\ m\\leq\\frac{1}{2} \\end{cases}$\n即 $-1\\leq m\\leq\\frac{1}{2}$\n综上，$m$ 的取值范围为 $m\\leq-2$ 或 $-1\\leq m\\leq\\frac{1}{2}$。",
        "answer_parts": [],
        "uncertain_fragments": [],
        "status": "ok",
        "evidence_note": "C001 context and answer_detail_01 show the retained handwritten steps in the draft order: A={x|-2<x<2}, B={x|x<-1 or x>3}, A∩B={x|-2<x<-1}, (complement_R B)∪A={x|-2<x≤3}, then (2) C⊆A with empty-set case m-1≥2m+1 and non-empty case system m≥-1, m≤1/2, ending with the summary line m≤-2 or -1≤m≤1/2; the scribbled-out token before C⊆A is cancelled and correctly absent from the draft; red underline and red '10' are marker ink, not student content.",
        "symbol_observations": [],
