      "choice_mode": "",
      "section_heading_before": "",
      "question_markdown": "16. （本小题满分15分）已知 $a\\in\\mathbb{R}$，$p:\\forall x\\in\\{x\\mid 0\\leq x\\leq 1\\}$，$a\\leq x^2+1$；$q:\\exists x_0\\in\\mathbb{R}$，$x_0^2+2ax_0-(2a-3)=0$。\n(1) 若 $p$ 是真命题，求 $a$ 的最大值；\n(2) 若 $p$ 为假命题且 $q$ 为真命题，求 $a$ 的取值范围。",
      "question_review": {
        "status": "reviewed_via_api2_atomic_patch",
        "source_context_ids": [
          "C002"
        ],
        "recognition_profile_version": "symbol_profile_v3",
        "symbol_audit_target_count": 0,
        "symbol_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_version": "figure_audit_v1",
        "figure_audit_target_count": 0,
        "figure_audit_observed_count": 0,
        "figure_observations": [],
        "lint_actions": [
          "kept_first_pass_answer_byte_exact"
        ],
        "context_manifest": "/home/puppeteer/MathOCRClaw/benchmark/test_runs/04-api2-triple-average/qwen3.8-max/workflow/page25/code_outputs/match/question_contexts.json"
      },
      "handwritten_answer": {
        "text": "解：$\\because p$ 为真命题\n$\\therefore$ 当 $x=1$ 时\n$x^2+1$ 最大，\n此时 $x^2+1=2$\n$\\therefore$ 有 $a\\leq 2$\n则 $a_{\\max}=2$\n(2) $\\because p$ 为假命题\n$\\therefore \\exists x\\in\\{x\\mid 0\\leq x\\leq 1\\}, a>x^2+1$\n$\\therefore a>(x^2+1)_{\\max}$\n$\\therefore a>2$\n$\\because q$ 为真命题\n$\\therefore$ 在方程 $x_0^2+2ax_0-(2a-3)=0$ 时，\n$\\Delta=4a^2+4(2a-3)\\geq 0$\n即 $4a^2+8a-12\\geq 0$\n解得 $a\\leq-3$ 或 $a\\geq 1$\n综上 $a$ 的取值范围为 $a\\leq-3$ 或 $a>2$",
        "answer_parts": [],
        "uncertain_fragments": [],
        "status": "ok",
